{"id":"en_dubbed-sweet-destiny-with-you","title":"(Dubbed) Sweet Destiny with You","titleEn":"(Dubbed) Sweet Destiny with You","description":"Nicole Smith takes drastic measures to avoid the marriage her mother arranged for her: she spends a night with a man she does not know and leaves home, later discovering she is pregnant. Five years on, she is raising her son Danny Smith on her own and facing daily hardships. That is when Marcus Jansen enters her life and sets out to win her over. His childhood sweetheart, Zoey Reeves, is consumed by jealousy and repeatedly stirs up problems for them. Neither Nicole nor Marcus realizes that he is Danny's father, and Nicole's real identity conceals further revelations.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/dubbed-sweet-destiny-with-you/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/dubbed-sweet-destiny-with-you/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dh3to/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_dubbed-sweet-destiny-with-you_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dh3to/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_dubbed-sweet-destiny-with-you_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dh3to/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_dubbed-sweet-destiny-with-you_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dh3to/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_dubbed-sweet-destiny-with-you_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble 